;; while a known hostile could reach the body or shoot it through it; a heard mob is not in a cell the body sees, and the
;; hut's seen wall stops its arrows. Lit plot: the seal opens onto no dark (no :night keep).
{:defaults
 {:tags [:access :go-to :hostile :shelter] :time :any
  :body {:inventory [["iron_pickaxe" 1] ["iron_sword" 1]] :effects [["resistance" 600 4]]}
  :limit-s 90}
 :cases
 [{:name "heard-skeleton-in-a-sealed-cave-the-seal-is-taken-back"
   ;; a dirt hut (inside x 8..10 z 10..12, roof y 2) whose east wall cells [11 0 11] [11 1 11] are its :shelter seal; a
   ;; sealed stone cave (inside x 2..5) against its west wall holds a NoAI skeleton, heard, never seen; the walk east to
